      "writtenOn": "2021-06-01T07:30:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you also add a unit test that when a VPN that already has a proxy connects, the broadcast is sent? I think the code will do this, but I\u0027m not sure.\n\nEven if it does, though: is the broadcast correctly sent *after* the VPN goes into CONNECTED state? Looking at the code I think it can happen that the broadcast is sent before the VPN goes into CONNECTED state. This could create a race where if an app calls ConnectivityManager#getDefaultProxy as soon as it receives the broadcast (e.g., in the BroadCastReceiver registered to receive the broadcast), it could get null because the VPN isn\u0027t actually connected yet.",
